Hi Simone,

maybe this helps:

[code START]
>>> import numpy

>>> a = [[1,2,3],[4,5,6]]

>>> aa = numpy.array(a)

>>> aa
array([[1, 2, 3],
       [4, 5, 6]])

>>> import rpy2.robjects as ro

>>> import rpy2.robjects.numpy2ri

>>> aR = ro.conversion.py2ri(aa)

>>> aR
<RArray - Python:0x014E7D00 / R:0x0211AF98>

>>> print aR
     [,1] [,2] [,3]

[1,]    1    2    3

[2,]    4    5    6

[code END]


cheers
Oliver



